      "statement": "ingest performs a two-call flow: POST /v1/projects/{id}/ingestions/check with the manifest JSON to learn missing sha256 hashes, then POST /v1/projects/{id}/ingestions as multipart with the manifest plus a gzipped tar archive containing only the files whose hashes are missing.",
